;; Card 64a7db75: a drowned swimming below the surface of a pond beside the shore is a danger (hostile-near fires): the body stands
;; on dry stone, the drowned (NoAI, helmeted: never hurts, no sun burn) floats one block under the water surface 3 blocks away.
;; A player sees through water and knows a drowned surfaces and comes ashore (or throws its trident).
;; Stone x 3..30, z 9..23, y -1..2 with a pond x 4..14, z 10..22, water y 0..2 (surface level with the shore, top feet y 3).
;; Should-succeed: the hostile-near reflex fires within 10 s.
;; A drowned holding a trident is ranged: seen across the pond at 11 blocks (beyond the 8 of a melee mob) it still fires.
;; A drop in the water beside a drowned (11 blocks off, no danger to the body) is left, not swum to: collect-drops leaves it :water-danger.
{:defaults
 {:tags [:hostile :survival :water]
  :time :any
  :register [{:trigger :hostile-near}]
  :blocks [[:fill [3 -1 9] [30 2 23] "stone"]
           [:fill [4 0 10] [14 2 22] "water"]]
  :body {:at [16.5 3 16.5] :effects [["resistance" 600 4]]}
  :limit-s 60}
 :cases
 [{:name "drowned-under-the-pond-surface-fires-hostile-near"
   :act [[:summon "drowned" [13.5 1 16.5] "{NoAI:1b,equipment:{head:{id:\"minecraft:iron_helmet\",count:1}}}"]]
   :expect [{:event {:source :reflex :kind :fired :context {:reflex-id :hostile-near}} :within-s 10}]}
  {:name "drowned-with-a-trident-across-the-pond-fires-hostile-near"
   :blocks [[:set [3 3 16] "torch"] [:set [3 3 18] "torch"]]
   :body {:yaw 90}
   :act [[:summon "drowned" [5.5 2 16.5] "{NoAI:1b,equipment:{mainhand:{id:\"minecraft:trident\",count:1},head:{id:\"minecraft:iron_helmet\",count:1}}}"]]
   :expect [{:event {:source :reflex :kind :fired :context {:reflex-id :hostile-near}} :within-s 10}]}
  {:name "drop-in-the-pond-beside-a-drowned-is-left"
   :register []
   :blocks [[:set [3 3 16] "torch"] [:set [3 3 18] "torch"]]
   :body {:yaw 90}
   :act [[:summon "drowned" [5.5 2 16.5] "{NoAI:1b,equipment:{head:{id:\"minecraft:iron_helmet\",count:1}}}"]
         [:summon "item" [6.5 2.2 16.5] "{Item:{id:\"minecraft:cobblestone\",count:1}}"]
         [:job (jobs.items.collect-drops {:radius 14})]]
   :expect [{:event {:source :job :level :debug :kind :collect-drops.left :data {:reason :water-danger}} :within-s 40 :of-job true}]
   :after [[:item "cobblestone" 0]]}]}
